00:35:43.276 --> 00:35:48.759
1,000 app instances all fail at the same moment (pricing restarted) and retry.

606
00:35:49.039 --> 00:36:01.156
The server has 100 units of work. per 10 ms tick: serving a call costs 1 unit, REJECTING one still costs 0.25 (accept, parse, reply 503).

