1084
01:07:11.072 --> 01:07:11.989
Overload:

1085
01:07:12.269 --> 01:07:15.747
Bounded queues + deadline-aware shedding + priorities.

1086
01:07:16.027 --> 01:07:17.413
Feature not essential:

1087
01:07:17.693 --> 01:07:20.253
Degradation catalogue + brownout flag.

1088
01:07:20.533 --> 01:07:21.579
Proving it works:

1089
